        {
            "title": "本地｜合謀定價罰款升至95萬 恒豐須付競委會訟費",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"本地｜合謀定價罰款升至95萬 恒豐須付競委會訟費\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">本地｜合謀定價罰款升至95萬 恒豐須付競委會訟費</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">競爭事務審裁處早前裁定恒豐酒店擁有人兼經營者「Prudential Hotel (BVI) Limited」合謀定價，違反《競爭條例》，罰款10萬4千元。競委會就罰款金額提出上訴獲判得直，上訴庭把罰款大幅調高至95萬元，並下令該公司支付競委會在上訴及原審階段的訟費。上訴庭認為原判罰款既不足以反映違法行為的嚴重程度，也缺乏針對性及一般性阻嚇作用。競委會指出，裁決確立協助企業落實反競爭行為的第三方同樣須負法律責任，判決具強烈阻嚇力。競委會早於2022年初入稟，指恒豐等六名答辯人在多間酒店銷售景點門票及車票時合謀定價。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-0d8c9f6b-220b-3348-9eef-180745a4b1a0-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-modu